# List of vulnerability IDs to be ignored by Trivy.

# Please provide a comment with each vulnerability ID describing why it has been ignored.

# image-size (transitive dev-only dep of metro@0.83.7, pinned to ^1.0.2; metro calls imageSize() with a bare file-path string, an overload image-size v2 dropped, so forcing v2 via a resolution breaks Metro's asset bundling entirely - verified 2026-09-28. No fix available until a metro/react-native upgrade, tracked separately.)

CVE-2025-71330
CVE-2025-71329

# activesupport (DoS in safe_constantize via Action Cable/untrusted input; build-time only dep of cocoapods in example/, not reachable. Patched only in >= 8.0.5.2, but cocoapods-core <= 1.17.0 pins activesupport < 8)

GHSA-8474-xrp6-wh69
